{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑初の御披露目編み込みヘアー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜の握手会、京都の握手会がありました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆様ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての方や、めっちゃ久しぶりの方、いつもの方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も沢山の方々に出会うことができました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝早い時間にもかかわらず沢山の方がまあやに逢いに来てくれて本当にありがとうございます"