es/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の笑顔で沢山の笑顔になることが出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった方、是非またきてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会える日を楽しみにしています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった方も応援いつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑京都の個別握手会の私服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/19/2553566/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会が終わって控え室でのビックリする話"}